<title>UK: Avesco plans placing to raise 7.1 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Avesco plans placing to raise 7.1 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Avesco Plc said on Thursday that it planned a placing and open offer of 2.67 million new ordinary shares at 282p a share to raise 7.1 million stg.</p>
<p>The offer will be on the basis of two new ordinary shares for every seven ordinary shares held at the close of business on November 14.</p>
<p>Avesco said the proceeds would be used to reduce borrowings and provide funds for further investment.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
